{
  "version": "2026-04-30",
  "source": "Artha-authored from real SMS samples collected on Sourav's own devices and public bank SMS format documentation. Fallback-only — hardcoded BANK_PATTERNS always run first.",
  "notes": [
    "Named capture groups consumed by sms-template-matcher.ts: amount, account, merchant, ref, balance, dueDate.",
    "tx_type: debit | credit | upi_debit | upi_credit | cc_debit | cc_credit | reminder_hint | balance_inquiry.",
    "priority: lower number = higher precedence within the same bank. Default 100.",
    "Regex compiled at runtime with the `i` flag. Patterns authored to minimise cross-bank collisions.",
    "Reminder entries are consumed by reminder-hints.ts and never materialise as expenses."
  ],
  "count": 56,
